  "question": {
    "text": "A rectangular solid box of length <math><mn>0.3</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> is held horizontally, with one of its sides on the edge of a platform of height <math><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> . When released, it slips off the table in a very short time <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#964;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.01</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math> , remaining essentially horizontal. The angle by which it would rotate when it hits the ground will be (in radians) close to:<br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/c20799a3-c7e5-45e0-98d1-fb33bcf2a026-image5.png\" />",
