    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/a4671cad-65aa-488e-8dba-e8456ef5a835-image6.png\"> <br/>Angular impulse = change in angular momentum <br/><math><mi>τ</mi><mi>Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>Δ</mi><mi>L</mi></math>  <br/><math><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>0.01</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi><msup><mrow><mi>l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>ω</mi></math>  <br/><math><mi>ω</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>g</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>0.01</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>l</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.01</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow></mrow></math>  <br/>Time taken by rod to hit the ground = <math><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>h</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math>  <br/>Angle rotated by rod = <math><mi>ω</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mi> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></math>",
